  "height": 380,
  "title": {
    "text": "Churn fell almost everywhere, whatever the pace of productivity growth",
    "subtitle": [
      "Change in real GVA per hour (chained volume, 2022 prices) against change in the job reallocation rate, 2004\u201308 to 2019\u201323.",
      "Each dot is an ITL2 region; changes between pooled windows. Red line = fit across all regions, navy = excluding London. Northern Ireland excluded where the earlier window starts before 2011.",
      "Sources: ONS Longitudinal Business Database (Secure Access, SN 9501); ONS Subregional productivity (June 2025); authors' calculations."
    ]
  },
